    "text": "Post Register\nwebsite\nBoise\nLight the World Giving Machines return to Treasure Valley for holiday season\nBy CBS2 News Staff,\n1 hours agoBOISE, Idaho (CBS2)— The Light the World Giving Machines are set to return to the Treasure Valley this holiday season, offering a unique opportunity for community members to become philanthropists with the push of a button. These life-changing vending machines will support seven Idaho-based nonprofits and two global charities.\n1",
